--

COMMENT ON COLUMN analysis.graph_node_projection.source_generation IS 'The projection generation this node was computed against. A disagreement between two lanes at the SAME generation is genuine divergence worth adjudicating; across DIFFERENT generations it is staleness and requires a re-run, not a decision. Telling them apart after the fact is impossible, which is why this is written at projection time.';


