COMMENT ON COLUMN registry.device.device_label IS 'Unique human-assigned device name, e.g. "Daughter iPhone 11 (handed down 2024-03)". Required via the ingest form / HITL prompt — make_model cannot distinguish two identical handsets and imei_or_serial is often unknown for second-hand devices.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN device.verification_state; Type: COMMENT; Schema: registry; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN registry.device.verification_state IS 'proposed = system-identified, untrusted. confirmed = owner ruled. disputed = flagged wrong. Corrections flow through canon.change_proposal, never direct edits.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN device.identification_signal; Type: COMMENT; Schema: registry; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN registry.device.identification_signal IS 'What the identification rests on, human-readable: e.g. "IMEI in export metadata" (clear) vs "inferred from message styling" (sketchy). The confidence number decides the lane; this column lets a human sanity-check the number.';


